#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"An introduction to a course designed to guide teams and organizations early "
"in their launch of quantum initiatives."
msgstr ""
"Pendahuluan untuk kursus yang dirancang untuk membimbing tim dan organisasi "
"di awal peluncuran inisiatif kuantum mereka."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Pendahuluan"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore bootcamps hackathons */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore bootcamps hackathons */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Welcome {#welcome}"
msgstr "Selamat datang {#welcome}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Welcome to Designing and Leading Quantum Projects, a course designed to "
"inform teams and organizations on how to develop capabilities required for "
"realizing quantum initiatives.\n"
msgstr ""
"Selamat datang di Mendesain dan Memimpin Proyek Kuantum, kursus yang "
"dirancang untuk memberi informasi kepada tim dan organisasi tentang cara "
"mengembangkan kapabilitas yang diperlukan untuk mewujudkan inisiatif "
"kuantum.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course is intended for academic, business, and organizational "
"leadership in the early stages of building quantum projects. The lessons "
"will cover common developmental stages and best practices identified by "
"successful innovators in the field. Most of the content will be applicable "
"across quantum projects broadly, though a few topics will be specific to a "
"particular type of partnership. For example, grant writing might be more "
"often applicable to academic researchers, though grants for startups and "
"enterprises are also important in this ecosystem.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kursus ini ditujukan untuk pimpinan akademis, bisnis, dan organisasi yang "
"berada di tahap awal membangun proyek kuantum. Pelajaran-pelajaran ini akan "
"mencakup tahapan pengembangan umum dan praktik terbaik yang diidentifikasi "
"oleh para inovator sukses di bidang ini. Sebagian besar konten akan berlaku "
"untuk proyek kuantum secara luas, meski beberapa topik akan spesifik untuk "
"jenis kemitraan tertentu. Misalnya, penulisan hibah mungkin lebih sering "
"berlaku untuk peneliti akademis, meskipun hibah untuk startup dan perusahaan"
" juga penting dalam ekosistem ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course is mostly non-technical. Technical jargon is limited to "
"descriptions of concrete example workflows, example wording for grant "
"proposals, and discussion of realistic deliverables and their constraints.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kursus ini sebagian besar bersifat non-teknis. Jargon teknis dibatasi pada "
"deskripsi contoh alur kerja konkret, contoh kata-kata untuk proposal hibah, "
"dan diskusi tentang hasil yang realistis beserta batasannya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The contents are organized as follows:\n"
msgstr "Kontennya disusun sebagai berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction\n"
msgstr "Pendahuluan\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Early stages - things to consider and have in place prior to large purchases"
" of quantum computing time, and prior to standing up a team\n"
msgstr ""
"Tahap awal - hal-hal yang perlu dipertimbangkan dan disiapkan sebelum "
"pembelian besar waktu komputasi kuantum, dan sebelum membentuk tim\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Standing up a team - key roles and responsibilities, attributes of "
"successful teams\n"
msgstr ""
"Membentuk tim - peran dan tanggung jawab utama, atribut tim yang sukses\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Grant writing - mapping best practices in general for grant writing in the "
"context of quantum computing\n"
msgstr ""
"Penulisan hibah - pemetaan praktik terbaik secara umum untuk penulisan hibah"
" dalam konteks komputasi kuantum\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Join us for this deep dive into building successful quantum projects!\n"
msgstr ""
"Bergabunglah bersama kami dalam pendalaman membangun proyek kuantum yang "
"sukses!\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Key players and audience {#key-players-and-audience}"
msgstr "Pemain utama dan audiens {#key-players-and-audience}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Below is a brief description of several key players in this ecosystem and "
"potential audiences for this course.\n"
msgstr ""
"Berikut adalah deskripsi singkat beberapa pemain utama dalam ekosistem ini "
"dan audiens potensial untuk kursus ini.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The IBM Quantum Network {#the-ibm-quantum-network}"
msgstr "IBM Quantum Network {#the-ibm-quantum-network}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The IBM Quantum Network is a worldwide collective shaping the future of "
"quantum computing. The hundreds of partners in the Network include Fortune "
"500 companies, universities, laboratories, and startups, all helping to "
"build a quantum economy. Partnership in the Network includes access to "
"exclusive meetings and select channels where the latest ideas in quantum are"
" shared. IBM Quantum Network partners collaborate even outside these events,"
" and benefit from close working relationships.\n"
msgstr ""
"IBM Quantum Network adalah kolektif global yang membentuk masa depan "
"komputasi kuantum. Ratusan mitra dalam Network ini mencakup perusahaan "
"Fortune 500, universitas, laboratorium, dan startup, yang semuanya membantu "
"membangun ekonomi kuantum. Kemitraan dalam Network mencakup akses ke "
"pertemuan eksklusif dan saluran pilihan tempat ide-ide terbaru dalam kuantum"
" dibagikan. Mitra IBM Quantum Network berkolaborasi bahkan di luar acara-"
"acara tersebut, dan mendapat manfaat dari hubungan kerja yang erat.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Every partner in the IBM Quantum Network is different, but some coarse-"
"binned categories are useful for context, such as startups, global systems "
"integrators (GSIs), academic institutions, non-academic research "
"institutions, and large enterprises.\n"
msgstr ""
"Setiap mitra dalam IBM Quantum Network berbeda-beda, namun beberapa kategori"
" kasar berguna untuk konteks, seperti startup, global systems integrators "
"(GSI), institusi akademis, lembaga penelitian non-akademis, dan perusahaan "
"besar.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Many of the guidelines and practices shared in this course were developed "
"and field-tested by partners in the IBM Quantum Network.\n"
msgstr ""
"Banyak panduan dan praktik yang dibagikan dalam kursus ini dikembangkan dan "
"diuji oleh mitra dalam IBM Quantum Network.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Startups:** Startups are agile, innovation‑driven companies that rapidly "
"turn new ideas into scalable business solutions. In the quantum computing "
"ecosystem, they play a pivotal role by accelerating technical breakthroughs,"
" commercializing niche capabilities, and bridging cutting‑edge research with"
" real‑world applications. Their speed and specialization help catalyze "
"growth across the entire industry.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Startup:** Startup adalah perusahaan yang gesit dan berorientasi inovasi "
"yang dengan cepat mengubah ide-ide baru menjadi solusi bisnis yang scalable."
" Dalam ekosistem komputasi kuantum, mereka memainkan peran penting dengan "
"mempercepat terobosan teknis, mengkomersialisasikan kemampuan khusus, dan "
"menjembatani penelitian mutakhir dengan aplikasi nyata. Kecepatan dan "
"spesialisasi mereka membantu mengkatalisasi pertumbuhan di seluruh "
"industri.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Global systems integrators (GSIs):** Global systems integrators (GSIs) are"
" large, end‑to‑end technology and services firms that help organizations "
"modernize, integrate, and scale complex digital solutions. In the quantum "
"computing ecosystem, they play a crucial role by enabling enterprise‑grade "
"adoption at a global scale. Their broad industry reach helps turn quantum "
"innovation into operational impact.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Global systems integrators (GSI):** Global systems integrators (GSI) "
"adalah perusahaan teknologi dan layanan end-to-end yang besar, yang membantu"
" organisasi untuk memodernisasi, mengintegrasikan, dan menskalakan solusi "
"digital yang kompleks. Dalam ekosistem komputasi kuantum, mereka memainkan "
"peran penting dengan memungkinkan adopsi enterprise-grade dalam skala "
"global. Jangkauan industri mereka yang luas membantu mengubah inovasi "
"kuantum menjadi dampak operasional.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Academic institutions:** These are universities, colleges, or consortia of"
" educational institutions. In the quantum computing ecosystem, they play a "
"central role by pushing the boundaries of theory and experimentation while "
"training the next generation of quantum scientists and engineers. Their "
"discoveries and expertise form the bedrock on which other organizations can "
"build their quantum impact.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Institusi akademis:** Ini adalah universitas, perguruan tinggi, atau "
"konsorsium institusi pendidikan. Dalam ekosistem komputasi kuantum, mereka "
"memainkan peran sentral dengan mendorong batas-batas teori dan eksperimen "
"sambil melatih generasi ilmuwan dan insinyur kuantum berikutnya. Penemuan "
"dan keahlian mereka membentuk fondasi di mana organisasi lain dapat "
"membangun dampak kuantum mereka.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Research institutions:** These are specialized organizations, like "
"national labs, focused on advancing scientific and technical knowledge "
"through dedicated, often mission‑driven R&D. In the quantum computing "
"ecosystem, they play a vital role by generating breakthrough discoveries, "
"developing enabling technologies, and providing deep domain expertise that "
"fuels innovation across industry and academia. Their educational initiatives"
" are often focused more on training rising researchers and less on classroom"
" education.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Lembaga penelitian:** Ini adalah organisasi khusus, seperti laboratorium "
"nasional, yang fokus pada kemajuan pengetahuan ilmiah dan teknis melalui R&D"
" yang berdedikasi dan sering didorong oleh misi. Dalam ekosistem komputasi "
"kuantum, mereka memainkan peran vital dengan menghasilkan penemuan "
"terobosan, mengembangkan teknologi pendukung, dan menyediakan keahlian "
"domain mendalam yang mendorong inovasi di seluruh industri dan akademia. "
"Inisiatif pendidikan mereka seringkali lebih berfokus pada pelatihan "
"peneliti yang berkembang dan kurang pada pendidikan di kelas.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Enterprise organizations:** Enterprise organizations are established "
"companies that apply technology to solve real business challenges, optimize "
"operations, and create competitive advantage at scale. In the quantum "
"computing ecosystem, they play a key role by identifying high‑value use "
"cases, funding applied innovation, and piloting solutions that demonstrate "
"measurable impact in real‑world environments.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Organisasi enterprise:** Organisasi enterprise adalah perusahaan yang "
"sudah mapan yang menerapkan teknologi untuk menyelesaikan tantangan bisnis "
"nyata, mengoptimalkan operasi, dan menciptakan keunggulan kompetitif dalam "
"skala besar. Dalam ekosistem komputasi kuantum, mereka memainkan peran kunci"
" dengan mengidentifikasi use case bernilai tinggi, mendanai inovasi terapan,"
" dan menguji solusi yang menunjukkan dampak terukur dalam lingkungan "
"nyata.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Quantum Innovation Centers {#quantum-innovation-centers}"
msgstr "Pusat Inovasi Kuantum {#quantum-innovation-centers}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Quantum Innovation Centers (QICs)** serve as elite centers of expertise in"
" the growing and ever-changing quantum ecosystem. Many operate as a hub, an "
"industry or academic leader growing a quantum community by partnering with "
"IBM&reg; directly, and serving as a central contact point for other "
"organizations. The QIC itself may be any of the organization types mentioned"
" above (academic institution, large enterprise, and so on).\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pusat Inovasi Kuantum (QIC)** berfungsi sebagai pusat keahlian elit dalam "
"ekosistem kuantum yang terus berkembang dan berubah. Banyak yang beroperasi "
"sebagai hub, pemimpin industri atau akademis yang menumbuhkan komunitas "
"kuantum dengan bermitra langsung dengan IBM&reg;, dan berfungsi sebagai "
"titik kontak utama bagi organisasi lain. QIC itu sendiri bisa berupa jenis "
"organisasi apa pun yang disebutkan di atas (institusi akademis, perusahaan "
"besar, dan sebagainya).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The resulting community around an IBM QIC has the potential to meet local "
"needs through a bottom-up approach, to offer a wider variety of quantum "
"computing access plans, and to leverage the community for broader expertise."
" This can be especially important for smaller organizations and startups. As"
" an IBM QIC, you establish your leadership in the field and build important "
"industry connections - and you are contributing to the ongoing growth of the"
" quantum community. **Collaborating with a QIC could facilitate more "
"competitive applications for governmental and private funding.**\n"
msgstr ""
"Komunitas yang dihasilkan di sekitar IBM QIC berpotensi memenuhi kebutuhan "
"lokal melalui pendekatan bottom-up, menawarkan variasi rencana akses "
"komputasi kuantum yang lebih luas, dan memanfaatkan komunitas untuk keahlian"
" yang lebih luas. Ini bisa sangat penting bagi organisasi kecil dan startup."
" Sebagai IBM QIC, kamu membangun kepemimpinanmu di bidang ini dan membangun "
"koneksi industri yang penting - dan kamu berkontribusi pada pertumbuhan "
"komunitas kuantum yang berkelanjutan. **Berkolaborasi dengan QIC bisa "
"memfasilitasi aplikasi yang lebih kompetitif untuk pendanaan pemerintah dan "
"swasta.**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Some QICs have their own IBM Quantum system on premises. This can be very "
"important when, for example, working with data that cannot legally or "
"responsibly be shared over the Internet, or across international borders.\n"
msgstr ""
"Beberapa QIC memiliki sistem IBM Quantum sendiri di lokasi. Ini bisa sangat "
"penting ketika, misalnya, bekerja dengan data yang secara hukum atau secara "
"bertanggung jawab tidak dapat dibagikan melalui Internet, atau melintasi "
"perbatasan internasional.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The quantum community {#the-quantum-community}"
msgstr "Komunitas kuantum {#the-quantum-community}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The broader community is driving quantum computing forward by lowering "
"barriers to entry and amplifying impact through both education and open-"
"source tooling. At universities, community-led teaching initiatives - like "
"bootcamps, hackathons, open syllabi, and student clubs - equip learners with"
" hands-on skills early, align curricula with fast-moving industry practices,"
" and create on-ramps for diverse talent to contribute. At the same time, "
"community contributions to Qiskit code, its documentation, and the IBM "
"Quantum Learning platform, make best practices discoverable and shorten the "
"path from idea to implementation. Together, this virtuous cycle of open "
"education and open-source development expands the talent pipeline, "
"standardizes shared tooling, and turns cutting-edge quantum concepts into "
"accessible, collaborative progress.\n"
msgstr ""
"Komunitas yang lebih luas mendorong komputasi kuantum ke depan dengan "
"menurunkan hambatan masuk dan memperkuat dampak melalui pendidikan dan "
"tooling open-source. Di universitas, inisiatif pengajaran yang dipimpin "
"komunitas - seperti bootcamp, hackathon, silabus terbuka, dan klub mahasiswa"
" - membekali peserta didik dengan keterampilan langsung sejak dini, "
"menyelaraskan kurikulum dengan praktik industri yang bergerak cepat, dan "
"menciptakan jalur bagi beragam bakat untuk berkontribusi. Pada saat yang "
"sama, kontribusi komunitas pada kode Qiskit, dokumentasinya, dan platform "
"IBM Quantum Learning, membuat praktik terbaik dapat ditemukan dan "
"mempersingkat jalur dari ide ke implementasi. Bersama-sama, siklus virtuous "
"pendidikan terbuka dan pengembangan open-source ini memperluas jalur bakat, "
"menstandarisasi tooling bersama, dan mengubah konsep kuantum mutakhir "
"menjadi kemajuan yang dapat diakses dan kolaboratif.\n"
